title: "presidio-hardened-arch-translucency: architectural translucency for replication analysis in Docker and Kubernetes"
abstract: >-
  Implementation of architectural translucency, the ability to monitor and
  compare replication at different layers of a system architecture, applied
  to the Docker and Kubernetes replication layers.
